# Preserve exact bytes.  The upstream B210 RTL uses a mix of CRLF and LF
# line endings, and the vendored Project X-Ray database is consumed
# byte-for-byte by the chip-database and bitstream tools.  Automatic EOL
# conversion would make the source manifest and database non-reproducible.
* -text

# Keep true binary artifacts out of textual diffs if they are ever added.
*.bit binary
*.bin binary
*.dcp binary
*.frames binary
*.bba binary
